# Files that live in this folder but must NEVER reach GitHub.
#
# This folder is the repository. Anything committed here is published twice:
# to a PUBLIC repo, and to canada-quiz.com itself, because GitHub Pages serves
# the repo. So "private" here means "listed below" — nothing else.
#
# _private/   plans, notes, session history, standing instructions. The owner's
#             working material. The repo carries the site and nothing else.
# _to_delete/ files moved aside for deletion; the bridge cannot delete directly
# _upd/       staging area for an update being prepared
# *.zip       the delivery zips — the site is already here, unzipped
_private/
_to_delete/
_upd/
*.zip
__pycache__/
*.pyc
